{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:81f954f7d04d880c97a569c36614bec95c3186035de828d611dc8b7770962b4b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79104946431f78f1d323f5809b86a40006710ff8395256d920b4aa4b8986aaf5",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。\n现在方便聊几句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e4bf1cc185f06b3b03752e884a270b8f6be7d1d7514634542917bdb994e7eb1",
      "text": "刚才和工作人员确认道具的时候，\n他们告诉了我一些知识。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1db8bac5236562afdb33c7d64086b2ff913a032e231f136f354eed00c3f5f43c",
      "text": "就是我用的那张世界地图，听说在过去并不是纸，\n而是写在动物皮上的，真让人惊讶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20edf9e6cc67dd5766bc3b6aedeed93ef5a06ed73a0be185c7968143e4e22f68",
      "text": "确实挺让人吃惊的呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90c4c7a835ee69778d336798a2461622653b0c8a4aefaa8b6749fe3c21a777b8",
      "text": "是羊皮纸吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c207b511383c8b1c5092dd077d9133f7cf0e3fa6665e943b355ab634579d16",
      "text": "是吧。听说叫做羊皮纸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b1d41180a064a1ef8c573ee7eb383461cd61ad27dae6dae56d06fd5af80addf",
      "text": "啊，原来您知道啊。\n真不愧是制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e27dc792155ff1b9a80bcd9b7b83a7a45e1dc0e95c7b491d720d467809e72ba7",
      "text": "居然能在纸张以外的东西上写字，\n真有意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb629f81538c6f765c8ad9058bd633a7c310a53472758d134bc5562676176ec8",
      "text": "这次用的道具，据说是工作人员用纸\n做成和羊皮纸一模一样的样子的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_b:2_4_032_01_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db39baca06d09c22933292e48f2eb1b46419afae7e67bb1cf51c507c3392a7fb",
      "text": "我想着什么时候能见见真正的羊皮纸呢。\n回去也打算和妈妈聊聊这件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
